Amazon (ha-amazon)

The Amazon sign-in module, custom_components/amazon_orders/account/auth.py,
contains code adapted from alexapy:

    alexapy
    Copyright Keaton Taylor and Alan Tse
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://gitlab.com/keatontaylor/alexapy

alexapy is the library behind Alexa Media Player
(https://github.com/alandtse/alexa_media_player). The adapted parts are the
sign-in URL, the device registration, the access-token refresh and the
token-to-cookie exchange from alexapy/alexalogin.py. They have been rewritten
to run on aiohttp alone and to fit this integration; alexapy itself is not a
dependency.

